로봇 Challenge」</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은고딕;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2.&nbsp;교육장소: 본교 테크노관 451호</span>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은고딕;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 224);\">3.&nbsp;교육일시:&nbsp;2025년 8월 13일(수) ~&nbsp;8월 14일(목)&nbsp; &lt;2일간&gt;</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은고딕; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4.&nbsp;모집인원: 50명</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은고딕; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">5.&nbsp;모집기간:&nbsp;2025년 7월&nbsp;22일(화) ~ 8월 4일(월)까지</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은고딕; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">6. 모집대상</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><strong style=\"font-family: 맑은고딕; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ●&nbsp;스마트모빌리티전공</strong><span style=\"font-family: 맑은고딕; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;1,2학년</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은고딕;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; line-height: 1;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ● AI로봇융합전공 참여학부(전공)&nbsp;</strong>소속 4학년 재학생</span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;*&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><em>참여학부(전공) : 기계공학부(기계공학전공, 기계시스템전공) /&nbsp;전자공학부(전자시스템전공) /&nbsp;컴퓨터공학부(컴퓨터공학전공, 인공지능공학전공)&nbsp;</em></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<em>&nbsp;(&nbsp;</em></span><em><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; line-height: 1;\">4학년을 우선 선발</strong>, 정원 미달시&nbsp;2~3학년 재학생에게도 참여 기회가 주어질 수 있습니다. )</span></em></p><div data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"7040\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;</div><div data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"7040\" id=\"hwpE